snippet.description:
Today, I Zhong… woke up at 3AM because the KPop Demon Hunters BROKE IN… and they told me to never do this at 3AM.

But wait… was it actually the KPop Demon Hunters… or was it my own FRIENDS?! I thought we were The Besties…

So to figure out who the intruder really is, I set up traps all around my house, like EXTREME Camouflage hide and seek, to catch whoever is sneaking in. But to watch everything go down… so i built a secret room to, I secretly hid inside a SECRET ROOM.

That’s when things got crazy… the intruder hits my traps at 3AM and RUNS AWAY… but then out of nowhere… I GO MISSING?!

Now it’s up to the police officer to figure out what happened to Zhong, and if I’m actually gone… or if this is all part of something bigger.

He finds a list of SUSPECTS, including the KPop Demon Hunters and my own friends, and now we have to go through a series of insane challenges to figure out who broke into my house at 3AM.

Watch till the end to find out what really happened…
